# Fire2Kodi

Android app to send video links to Kodi TV device via clipboard or send-to menu. Kore sends links to Kodi devices but cannot translate them for the specific video Addons. This app translates links from web for various video Addons.

Get on F-Droid Repository IzzyOnDroid

# Youtube, Rumble, Odysee, Lbry, Bitchute, Dailymotion, Vimeo, Twitch, Kick, Amazon Prime, Joyn

I do not have subscriptions for the various streaming services, if you find errors please open an issue.

